; The stand-in PlayStation 2 AV lead: an AV MULTI plug at the console end, three
; phonos at the set. dc_av_cable.tscn with a different plug script and plug. It is
; offered on a card whose console names the "ps2_av_multi" socket (a mod's; see
; ModConnectors) until a mod brings a modelled lead, so such a console is never
; left with no way to reach a television.
;
; The plug is a box of Sony's measurements: the moulded body, 21.7 x 11.4 mm and
; 37.2 mm long, outside the case, and the metal shell that runs 7 mm into the
; socket along the plug's +Z. The origin is the body's front face, which is the
; frame a mod's socket seats a plug in. The collision box is the body only.
;
; The console end is a SHARED end carrying all three cords -- see CompositeCable.
[node name="Ps2AvCable" type="Node3D"]
script = ExtResource("1_cablescript")
wire_color = Color(0.07, 0.07, 0.075, 1.0)


